{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the galaxy in minutes, not hours.</strong><br><i>Orion Wars</i> is a streamlined fusion of 4X strategy and real-time space battles. Games last 10\u201325 minutes, with only two unit types to command\u2014but thousands can clash at once. Every decision matters as you choose your path to victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Ways to Win</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Domination<strong>:</strong> Seize every star system in the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singularity Ascension<strong>:</strong> Complete every branch of research and transcend the universe itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short-session 4X<strong>:</strong> Deep strategy that fits into a lunch break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive real-time battles<strong>:</strong> Hundreds to thousands of units fighting across the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamlined control<strong>:</strong> Just two unit types\u2014but endless tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research tree<strong>:</strong> Unlock weapons, defenses, and the ultimate Singularity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable<strong>:</strong> Procedural galaxies, different difficulty levels, and alien opponents to conquer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006990?t=1759888691","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006990/ef3aa218bcdd28244d9070fff808f96099e927f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759888691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006990/20d2f022fd5087c0a58a7a7d3475325680d94ecb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759888691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006990